  "longBusinessSummary": "Mühlbauer Holding AG provides equipment solutions for manufacturing, personalization, and shipping in Germany, the rest of Europe, Asia, the Americas, Africa, and internationally. The company offers systems and technologies for ID cards, driver's licenses and vehicle registration cards, banking cards, gift and loyalty cards, health cards, and GSM cards; and high-precision equipment, such as die and wire bonding, encapsulation, tape inspection, molding, electrical test and pre-personalization, and flip chip IC module production. It also provides card body production products, including tape layering, sheet hot stamping, foil punching, inlay testing, sheet collating, sheet lamination, card punching, card inspection, and card hot stamping; and smart card production comprising chip module testing and pre-personalization, glue tape lamination, smart card milling, dual interface card production, smart card implanting, combined milling and implanting, and chip module punching. In addition, the company offers card personalization and mailing products; and software solutions consisting of EMV, instant issuance, and production and personalization management software. Mühlbauer Holding AG was founded in 1981 and is headquartered in Roding, Germany.",
